5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I am Minato. I like to watch the sky.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Greetings. Benjamin here. Logic is my compass in this fog.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Peace be with you. I am Servas. Wisdom comes from listening.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi! I'm May. Let's make this fun, shall we?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Takumi. I don't like hiding. Let's be straight with each other.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I wonder if we should share our feelings openly?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Transparency is risky, but silence breeds suspicion. Balance is key.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,A calm heart sees clearly. Do not rush to judgment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, are you hiding something, or just being mysterious?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop teasing. @Benjamin, I agree. Honesty builds trust.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I feel a bit nervous. Is that normal for a villager?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Nervousness is human. But watch for those who are too calm.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,Fear is a shadow. It does not define the light within.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, you seem shy. Are you the Seer? Just asking!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, that's rude. @Minato, don't let her scare you.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I am just a simple boy. I will try my best.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"We all have roles. Let the evidence speak, not the noise.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,The path is long. Walk it with kindness and caution.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Alright, I'll behave. For now. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Goodnight. I'm staying up to watch the stars. Stay safe.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
