31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I slept well. Did anyone have dreams?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I had a clear vision. Takumi is human. I am the Seer.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"A bold claim, Benjamin. The truth is a heavy stone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, really? You're the Seer? That's convenient.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, I trust you. I told you I was honest.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,I don't know much about Seers. Is that a good thing?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,It means I can guide us. Takumi is clean. Who is the wolf?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Guidance is a gift, but it must be verified by the group.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're being so vague. Are you the wolf, Servas?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop it! @Benjamin, I stand with you. Let's find the wolf.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,I feel like May is being a bit too loud. Is that bad?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Loudness can be a mask. But Takumi's support is solid.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,The loudest voice is not always the truest. Listen to the silence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, I'm just having fun! @Servas, you're boring.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're making it hard for us. @Benjamin, who do you suspect?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,I think we should vote for the one who seems least friendly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, that's dangerous. @Servas, your silence is suspicious.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Suspicion is the seed of doubt. Let it grow, but do not plant it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're targeting Servas? I like that. Let's do it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, I agree. Servas is too quiet. Let's vote Servas.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
