64,2,1,talk,Minato,,Oh no. Servas is gone. And Takumi too. I am so sad.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The wolf struck Takumi. Servas was executed. We are down to three.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you were right about Takumi. But you were wrong about Servas.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Minato,,I don't understand. Why did Takumi die? I thought he was safe.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The wolf is still among us. May, you are human. I checked.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
